================================================================================
PARITY (web AnalyticsSummaryWidget.tsx -> native)
================================================================================
Data:    useAnalyticsSummary (GET /analytics/fleet) -> totalDistanceKm, avgEfficiencyWhKm,
         totalEnergyKwh, totalCost (+ forward-looking *Trend arrays). Bound through the P1/S8
         AnalyticsSummarySource seam; the view performs no networking.
Pipeline (ported verbatim): displayDist = convertDistanceFromSI(totalDistanceKm*1000, unit);
         displayEff = unit=='mi' ? effWhKm*1.60934 : effWhKm (Wh/mi | Wh/km, mi-only special case);
         costPerDist = displayDist>0 ? totalCost/displayDist : 0 (formatCurrency …,3 | '—');
         fmtNumber via NumberFormatter halfUp == Intl halfExpand.
Layouts: compact (cols<=1) big animated distance + unit + "Total Distance"; standard (2-up grid);
         wide (cols>=4) 4-up grid + Sparkline row when *Trend arrays present (hasSparklines).
States:  loading (skeleton) / empty (web hasData gate: distKm>0||energyKwh>0, all-zero => empty) /
         error (retry) / stale (chip + auto-refresh) / offline (cached + banner) / content.
i18n:    every source key through the P1/S10 facade (table AnalyticsSummaryWidget); no English
         literals in code; costPerDist {{unit}} -> %@ positional placeholder.
Tokens:  P1/S9 Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius; web text-{cyan,emerald,amber,purple}-400
         icon accents -> accent/statusSuccess/statusWarning/chartSeriesPower; no Tailwind ported.
Shared:  data-display StatCard -> AnalyticsSummaryStatTile; charts Sparkline -> TSSparkline;
         feedback EmptyState -> ContentUnavailableView; AnimatedNumber -> TSAnimatedNumber;
         skeletons -> TSStatGridSkeleton/TSSkeleton.
A11y:    VoiceOver labels on every tile + the grid + compact value + chip + refresh/open buttons;
         Dynamic Type (minimumScaleFactor); Reduce-Motion respected via TSSkeleton/TSAnimatedNumber.
Telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened emitted once with slug "AnalyticsSummaryWidget" on model.start().
Registry: id "analytics-summary", category analytics, default 2x2, min 1x2, max 4x40 (clamp enforced).

